    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 15 - Contact Data Cleaning: Code vs No-code\nThe same messy contact list cleaned two ways, side by side.\n\n**Top lane (No-code):** Edit Fields expressions → Filter valid emails → Remove Duplicates by email.\n\n**Bottom lane (Code):** one Code node that converts Arabic digits, fixes email typos (gmial, .con), formats phones to +970..., title-cases names, merges duplicates by email **or** phone (union-find), keeps the most complete values and explains every rejected row.\n\nClean contacts are upserted to `Clean`, rejected rows go to `Rejected`, and a Telegram report compares both lanes.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
